From: variablestarlight at gmail.com (Chief Return Officer (CRO) - GRASS GIS election 2024)
Date: Fri, 6 Sep 2024 13:00:00 +0200
Subject: [GRASS-stats] [GRASS GIS PSC Elections 2024] Announcement,
 time table and voters registry
Message-ID: <7955ba17-7f79-44df-baa2-957ea88acee6@osgeo.org>

Dear members of the GRASS GIS community,

We are launching the 2024 election of the Project Steering Committee 
(PSC) on Monday 16 September 2024. The PSC currently has nine (9) 
members. Four (4) seats are open for renewal in this election, offering 
an opportunity for new members to join the committee.

The nominating and voting process is explained in full detail in the 
election Wiki (https://grasswiki.osgeo.org/wiki/PSC_Election_2024).

In summary the election will proceed as follows:
- nomination period: 2024-09-16 to 2024-10-07
- presentation of the candidates: 2024-10-07 to 2024-10-14
- elections: 2024-10-21 to 2024-10-28
- announcement of the newly elected PSC: 2024-11-02 at latest

Eligible voters are people who:
- have one or more merged pull requests in any of grass, grass-addons, 
grass-website, grass-promo repositories,
- participated of GRASS PSC and community events,
- have one or more merged pull requests in qgis/QGIS related to GRASS 
integration,
- have one or more merged pull requests in rsbivand/rgrass, or
- are registered and have translated for GRASS GIS in Weblate

A list of eligible voters according to these criteria has already been 
compiled. The list can be found here 
<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1GdZUcwERaIJur9fXs1D05Sw-Jv57N3LfQ8njfM6Jd-4/edit?gid=0#gid=0>. 
If you believe you meet the criteria but do not find your name in the 
list, please contact the CRO (cro.grass at osgeo.org) or make a pull 
request before 15 September 2024.


Hern?n De Angelis

Chief Return Officer (CRO)
GRASS GIS election 2024
